<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1656] z.show in Python interpreter does not work</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1656</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1345&quot; title=&quot;Create a custom matplotlib backend that natively supports inline plotting in a python interpreter cell&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1345&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1345&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, even without &lt;tt&gt;py4j&lt;/tt&gt; installed, simple paragraphs that use &lt;tt&gt;z.show()&lt;/tt&gt; can not be run&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pandas as pd

df = pd.read_csv(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;https:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/machine-learning-databases/iris/iris.data&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, header=None)
&lt;/span&gt;df.columns=[&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;SepalLength&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;SepalWidth&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;PetalLength&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;PetalWidth&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Name&apos;&lt;/span&gt;]
z.show(df)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;results in &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;raceback (most recent call last):
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&amp;lt;stdin&amp;gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 1, in &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;
AttributeError: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;list&apos;&lt;/span&gt; object has no attribute &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;show&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
Traceback (most recent call last):
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&amp;lt;stdin&amp;gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 1, in &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;
AttributeError: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;list&apos;&lt;/span&gt; object has no attribute &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;_displayhook&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected result - get Zeppelin build-in visualization of the DataFrame&lt;/p&gt;</description>
